MooTool offline OCR resources

PP-OCRv6 small detection/recognition weights originate from PaddleOCR
(Baidu/PaddlePaddle rights holders), converted and distributed by RapidAI
as RapidOCR v3.10.0. Model weights: Apache-2.0; ownership remains with the
upstream rights holders. The character dictionary is extracted from the
verified recognition model without changing the model.

Pipeline adapted from RapidOCR v3.10.0's DB detection, crop/resize and CTC
decoding and PaddleOCR's original algorithms. Copyright (c) 2021 RapidOCR
Authors; Copyright (c) 2020 PaddlePaddle Authors. Modifications for MooTool:
JavaScript/OpenCV.js CPU pipeline, bounded resources, original image crops,
process isolation and MooTool's result protocol. Apache-2.0.

